        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Briana Corrigan, Dave Hemingway\n- Songs: \"A Little Time\"\n- Albums: Choke\n- Bands: the South\n- Topics: chart performance, vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Briana Corrigan was born on 30 May 1965 and is a Northern Irish singer.\n- \"A Little Time\" consists of a duet featuring vocalists Dave Hemingway and Briana Corrigan.\n- \"A Little Time\" was the South's first and only number 1 single.\n- The album Choke was pushed to number 2 in the charts after the release of the South's first and only number 1 single, \"A Little Time\".",
